*                                                                       S7090020
*                                                 J H BRAUN   APRIL 1962S7090030
*                           ADDRESS IBM, 447 E BROAD, COLUMBUS 15, OHIO S7090040
*                                                                       S7090050
*      THIS SIMULATOR IS DESIGNED TO PERFORM THE FOLLOWING 709 INSTRUC- S7090060
*              TIONS NOT PRESENT ON THE 7040/44.                        S7090070
*        ADM  ANS  AXC  CAQ  CLM  CRQ  CVR  DVH  ERA  ENK  FAM  FDH     S7090080
*        FRN  FSM  HTR  MPR  NZT  ORS  RND  SBM  SLF  SLN  SLQ  SLT     S7090090
*        SSM  STP  STT  TLQ  TNO  TQP  UAM  USM  XCA  XCL  ZET          S7090100
*        IIA  IIL  IIR  IIS  LDI  LFT  LNT  OAI  OFT  ONT  OSI  PAI     S7090110
*        PIA  RFT  RIA  RIL  RIR  RIS  RNT  SIL  SIR  STI  TIF  TIO     S7090120
*                                                                       S7090130
*      PSE IS ALSO SIMULATED TO ALLOW FOR SLN AND SLF CODED AS PSE.     S7090140
*                                                                       S7090150
*      THE SIMULATOR OPERATES BY USING THE 3 STORE AND TRAP INSTRUCTIONSS7090160
*              ON THE 7040/44 WHICH ARE TO BE INSERTED BY A MODIFIED    S7090170
*              ASSEMBLY PROGRAM OR BY A PREPROCESSOR PROGRAM.  THE TYPE S7090180
*              OF INSTRUCTION BEING SIMULATED IS DETERMINED FROM BITS   S7090190
*              12 TO 17 OF THE STR AND ALSO BY THE TYPE OF STR.         S7090200
*                                                                       S7090210
*              A STR OF -0000 IS USED FOR INDIRECT ADDRESSING.          S7090220
*              A STR OF -1000 IS USED FOR DIRECT ADDRESSING.            S7090230
*              A STR OF +0000 IS USED FOR CONVERT INSTRUCTIONS.         S7090240
*                      BITS 12,13 ARE 01 FOR CAQ, 10 FOR CRQ, 11 FOR CVRS7090250
*                      THUS, ONLY COUNTS FROM 0 TO 15 ARE ALLOWED.      S7090260
*                                                                       S7090270
*      THE DECIMAL VALUE OF THE COUNT FIELD FOR CODIFYING THE OTHER     S7090280
*              INSTRUCTIONS MAY BE FOUND IN THE COMMENTS FIELD OF THE   S7090290
*              LISTING PRECEDING SYMBOLIC LOCATION COD.                 S7090300
*                                                                       S7090310
*      THE SIMULATOR MUST BE INITIALIZED BY STORING IN LOCATION 2       S7090320
*              THE COMMAND  TRA  S709                                   S7090330
*                                                                       S7090340
*PROGRAM IS RELOCATABLE, BUT FOR TEST PURPOSES WE ARE USING ABSOLUTE.   S7090350
       ABS                                                              S7090360
*THE FOLLOWING 4 LINES ARE USED ONLY FOR ASSEMBLY ON A 709 OR 7090.     S7090370
 PCS   OPD     -150573140002       PLACE CHARACTER FROM STORAGE         S7090380
 SAC   OPD     -162373140002       STORE ACCUMULATOR CHARACTER          S7090390
 TSL   OPD     -162771140000       TRANSFER AND SET LOCATION.           S7090400
 VMA   OPD     -120411140002       VARIABLE LENGTH MULT AND ACCUMULATE. S7090410
*                                                                       S7090420
       ORG     32000        SUGGESTED ORIGIN, MAY BE CHANGED.           S7090430
 S709  SXA     IR4,4        SAVE IR4.                                   S7090440
       LAC     0,4          SET FOR PICKUP.                             S7090450
       SLW     ACLXX        SAVE                                        S7090460
       ARS     36           ENTIRE                                      S7090470
       STO     ACHXX        ACCUMULATOR.                                S7090480
       CLA     -1,4         PICKUP THE STR OR POSSIBLY AN XEC.          S7090490
       PDX     TLO-1,4      SET CODE FOR OPERATION.  AD. USED BY DIVH+3 S7090500
       STO     ATXXX        STORE THE STR OR XEC                        S7090510
       TPL     CNV          TRANSFER FOR CONVERT OR XEC.                S7090520
       TXH     ERR,4,COD-MON-1  ERROR IF IR4 EXCEEDS MAX CODE.          S7090530
       CAL     COD,4        SETUP NON-INDEXED                           S7090540
       STA     GSM          TRANSFER TO PROPER SIMULATION.              S7090550
 IR4   AXT     --,4         RESTORE IR4 NOW.                            S7090560
       CLA     ATXXX        PICKUP THE STR.                             S7090570
       CAS     MON          COMPARE TO A PURE STR.                      S7090580
       TRA     *+1          HERE FOR INDIRECT ADDRESS.                  S7090590
       CLA*    ATXXX        FETCH NEW ADDRESS AND TAG.                  S7090600
       ANA     MSKAT        CORRECT ADDRESS AND TAG IN AC               S7090610
       SLW     ATXXX        AND STORAGE CELL.                           S7090620
 GSM   TRA     --           GO TO PROPER SIMULATION.                    S7090630
 MON   MON                  PURE STR.                                   S7090640
* * * * * * * * * ** INSERT ADDITIONAL CODES HERE ** * * * * * * * * *  S7090650
       PZE     PSE          56 CODE ADDED--POSSIBLE SLN OR SLF.         S7090660
