 MAG   PZE     --           ADDRESS IS ONE MORE THAN LOC OF TSL MAG.    S7091230
       CAL*    ATXXX        FETCH ARGUMENT.                             S7091240
       STO     TMP          STORE ABSOLUTE VALUE.                       S7091250
