       ORA     *+4          SET TAG INTO LOAD ADDRESS COMPLEMENTED INST.S7091440
       SLW     *+1          STORE COMMAND FOR EXECUTION.                S7091450
 TMP   PZE                  LAC ATXXX,T OR TEMPORARY STORAGE.           S7091460
