       TRA*    0                                                        S7091590
*THE FOLLOWING SIMULATION OF FRN ASSUMES THAT IT IS BEING USED TO       S7091600
*ROUND A DOUBLE PRECISION NUMBER.  IN THIS CASE THERE WILL BE NO Q OR   S7091610
*P BITS.  SEE WRITE-UP.  ALSO SEE APPENDIX.                             S7091620
 FRN   STQ     MQ           SAVE MQ.                                    S7091630
       RQL     9            POSITION 9 BIT IN HIGH MQ.                  S7091640
       CLA     0            SAVE EXIT ADDRESS TO AVOID LOSS IN          S7091650
       STA     FRNX         THE EVENT OF A FLOATING PT. TRAP.           S7091660
       CAL     ACLXX        AC LOGICAL.                                 S7091670
       ANA     MSKCH        ISOLATE CHARACTERISTIC.                     S7091680
       ARS     1            CREATE FLOATING NUMBER                      S7091690
       LGL     1            WITH MQ 9 BIT IN AC 35.                     S7091700
       UFA     ACLXX        ABSOLUTE ROUND                              S7091710
       LDQ     ACHXX        RESTORE                                     S7091720
       LLS     0            AC SIGN.                                    S7091730
       LDQ     MQ           RESTORE MQ.                                 S7091740
 FRNX  TRA     --           GO TO NEXT INSTRUCTION.                     S7091750
