 ARS   ARS     --           MOVE BIT TO AC POSITION N+2.                S7092450
       ORA     SLXXX        TURN LIGHT ON.                              S7092460
 SLF   SLW     SLXXX        STORE LIGHTS.                               S7092470
       TRA     OUT          EXIT.                                       S7092480
