 TNO   TOV     OUT          IF OVERFLOW, NORMAL EXIT. OVERFLOW LIGHT OFFS7092630
       TRA     TIO+4        NO OVERFLOW, GO TO RESTORE AC AND TRANSFER. S7092640
 TQP   LLS     0            MQ SIGN TO AC.                              S7092650
