       CLA     0            SET EXIT. THIS AVOIDS LOSS IN EVENT OF      S7092790
       STA     TLO+1        FLOATING PT. TRAP IN SIMULATING FDH.        S7092800
       CAL     S709+6       ADDRESS IS TLO-1.                           S7092810
